flowchart TD
    A[Open AI Quiz inside GovtQuest] --> B[Choose PDF, DOCX or TXT]
    B --> C[Read the full uploaded document]
    C --> D[Read notes through FastAPI]
    D --> E{Selectable text?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Extract text]
    E -- No --> G[Reject scan and request typed notes]
    F --> H[Edit and confirm text in Flutter]
    G --> B
    H --> I[Choose count and difficulty]
    I --> J[Generate MCQs from reviewed passages]
    J --> K{Valid options, answer and source quote?}
    K -- Retry within limit --> J
    K -- Failed --> L[Show error and retry with richer notes]
    K -- Valid --> M[Store answer key in backend]
    M --> N[Answer questions in Flutter]
    N --> O[Submit to deterministic scoring]
    O --> P[Score, explanations and source quotes]
    P --> Q[History or fresh practice]
